/v1/","context":{"app_id":4715950,"app_scope":"base","country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100,"review_scope":"store_summary_filtered","percentage_precision":"source_rounded_integer","review_score_label":"사용자 평가 없음"},"error_code":"no_reviews"}],"events":[{"id":"steam-steam-4715950-1846651706677892","game_id":"steam-4715950","kind":"announcement","title":"Next Fest is Pucked Up!","summary":"Next Fest is upon us! Come check out the demo if you haven't already, or check it out again to see what is new. There are tons of amazing games this time around and I'm very excited for Pucked Up to be a part of this. Be sure to wishlist to get an alert the morning of the 27th when we launch (everything is ready to go). Show your friends, scream to the heavens, or if its just not your thing....... TELL NO ONE :)I can't wait for people to get their hands on the full version of the game, but until","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-15T14:13:05Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706677892","verified_at":"2026-10-20T16:20:21Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4715950-1844751498225055","game_id":"steam-4715950","kind":"update","title":"Demo v0.3 Update","summary":"Hello all,In preparation for the upcoming Next Fest this October (19th thru 26th), the demo has been moved into version 0.3. This includes a very wide swath of changes across pretty much all aspects of the build. Every change made has been to keep the demo as true to the current working 1.0 build as possible. Without getting too far into the weeds, here is a majority of what has changed from v0.2.v0.3added visual and audio cues to many player and card triggers to make interactions during play mo","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-25T15:52:18Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_commu